
Numero imparare: ['plus:'] significa: ['+'].
Numero on: ['+'] fare: { :x
	>> rate := 1.
	>> currency := x qual.
	(currency = ['euros']) vero: {
		rate := 2.
	}. <- (io plus: (x × rate)).
}.
>> dollars := 3.
>> euros := 2.
dollars qual: ['dollars'].
euros qual: ['euros'].
>> money := dollars + euros.
Uscita scrivi: money, stop.
